--- /dev/null
+++ b/examples/flutter-fbdev-backend/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# Overview
+
+This is the FBDEV backend. It renders via GPU (EGL/GLES on a render node) and
+blits frames to /dev/fb0, avoiding all DRM modesetting.
+
+## Building
+
+```Shell
+$ mkdir build
+$ cd build
+$ cmake -DUSER_PROJECT_PATH=examples/flutter-fbdev-backend ..
+$ cmake --build .
+```
+
+## Running Flutter app
+
+```Shell
+$ FLUTTER_FB_DEVICE="/dev/fb0" FLUTTER_EGL_DEVICE="/dev/dri/renderD128" ./flutter-fbdev-backend --bundle=FLUTTER_BUNDLE_PATH
+```
+
+Environment variables:
+- `FLUTTER_FB_DEVICE` - framebuffer device (default: `/dev/fb0`)
+- `FLUTTER_EGL_DEVICE` - GPU render node (default: `/dev/dri/renderD128`)
